WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.970
- This is my Whole Lotta Woman Hour,

00:00:01.970 --> 00:00:04.560
and in honor of International Women's Day,

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:06.760
we're checking in with
some of the gifted girls

00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:09.620
I've paired with successful
women, who inspired them.

00:00:09.620 --> 00:00:13.010
A few weeks ago, I surprised
a 12 year old fashionista

00:00:13.010 --> 00:00:15.050
with Baby Phat founder,
Kimora Lee Simmons.

00:00:15.050 --> 00:00:15.883
Check it out.

00:00:15.883 --> 00:00:16.716
(Electronic whooshing)

00:00:16.716 --> 00:00:18.750
How did you get into designing clothes?

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:19.700
- When I was eight,

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:21.700
me and my mom were cleaning out my closet.

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:23.660
I was like, mom, I don't
wanna give away my clothes,

00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:24.910
I wanna upcycle them.

00:00:24.910 --> 00:00:26.356
So she's like, what's upcycling?

00:00:26.356 --> 00:00:27.189
(Audience laughs)

00:00:27.189 --> 00:00:28.910
So, I told her what it was,

00:00:28.910 --> 00:00:31.890
and she enrolled me in
private sewing lessons.

00:00:31.890 --> 00:00:34.960
- But I do have a surprise for Skylar,

00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:36.330
the woman behind Baby Phat

00:00:36.330 --> 00:00:37.585
and so many other successful businesses,

00:00:37.585 --> 00:00:39.110
(audience gasps)

00:00:39.110 --> 00:00:41.900
Kimora Lee Simmons, come on out!

00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:44.900
(upbeat rock music)

00:00:47.130 --> 00:00:48.980
- I brought you a little something here.

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:51.980
And we just wanna tell you
how proud we are of you.

00:00:51.980 --> 00:00:53.810
And if you would be willing,

00:00:53.810 --> 00:00:56.570
I would like to accept you under my wing,

00:00:56.570 --> 00:00:58.562
(Audience gasps)
and offer you a mentorship.

00:00:58.562 --> 00:01:01.810
(Audience screams and claps)

00:01:01.810 --> 00:01:03.684
- What do you think?

00:01:03.684 --> 00:01:05.892
(Kimora laughs)

00:01:05.892 --> 00:01:07.003
- Oh.

00:01:07.003 --> 00:01:08.902
- Yeah!
(audience cheers and claps)

00:01:08.902 --> 00:01:11.358
Please welcome Kimora Lee Simmons, y'all.

00:01:11.358 --> 00:01:16.358
(upbeat rock music)
(audience cheers and claps)

00:01:27.853 --> 00:01:29.997
- Hi, how are you?
- Nice to see you.

00:01:29.997 --> 00:01:31.781
- Nice to see you.

00:01:31.781 --> 00:01:34.390
(Applause)

00:01:34.390 --> 00:01:36.590
- I feel like I didn't mean to do this

00:01:36.590 --> 00:01:38.510
but I invited like two beautiful models

00:01:38.510 --> 00:01:39.776
to sit next to for an hour.

00:01:39.776 --> 00:01:41.730
It's fine, I feel great about myself.

00:01:41.730 --> 00:01:43.920
So have you all meet before?

00:01:43.920 --> 00:01:45.150
- Yes
- We have

00:01:45.150 --> 00:01:46.950
- We kind of go way back in the 90s

00:01:46.950 --> 00:01:47.887
in New York, I think.
- [Kelly] Wow

00:01:47.887 --> 00:01:49.815
- I can tell you all those stories

00:01:49.815 --> 00:01:51.158
- [Kelly] How very TLC I like it

00:01:51.158 --> 00:01:52.978
- On another show for Woman's day

00:01:52.978 --> 00:01:54.170
(Laughter)

00:01:54.170 --> 00:01:56.330
- Well Kimora so since the show

00:01:56.330 --> 00:01:58.560
have you been able to
hang out with Skylar?

00:01:58.560 --> 00:02:00.150
or do anything with Skylar?

00:02:00.150 --> 00:02:01.250
- Of course yes.

00:02:01.250 --> 00:02:02.590
So she came to New York.

00:02:02.590 --> 00:02:05.100
We brought her to New York and um

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:09.170
she came into our studio or
"atelier Casa de Kimora."

00:02:09.170 --> 00:02:10.060
That's not really what's it called

00:02:10.060 --> 00:02:10.893
it's our Baby Phat head quarter

00:02:10.893 --> 00:02:12.230
- I want you to call it that

00:02:12.230 --> 00:02:13.330
it sounds fancy.

00:02:13.330 --> 00:02:14.940
- And she, we put her straight to work

00:02:14.940 --> 00:02:18.590
she had sketches, we've
lectured, we've mentored,

00:02:18.590 --> 00:02:20.640
we've reviewed all her things,

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:22.500
we've brought some things to life

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:24.093
she went all over the city.

00:02:24.093 --> 00:02:25.395
- [Kelly] Well New York is awesome

00:02:25.395 --> 00:02:26.940
she checked out fabric houses, yeah.

00:02:26.940 --> 00:02:29.450
- I would walk into those places
though and be overwhelmed,

00:02:29.450 --> 00:02:31.230
and y'all walk in and get inspired

00:02:31.230 --> 00:02:32.792
I'd be like there's so much fabric!

00:02:32.792 --> 00:02:33.625
(laughter)

00:02:33.625 --> 00:02:34.760
like, I mean like I do that like

00:02:34.760 --> 00:02:36.176
a Joanne just making quilts.

00:02:36.176 --> 00:02:37.070
(laughter)

00:02:37.070 --> 00:02:39.330
So a few weeks ago Kimora offered

00:02:39.330 --> 00:02:41.573
to mentor an extremely
talented twelve year-old

00:02:41.573 --> 00:02:42.406
fashionista, let's see what happened

00:02:42.406 --> 00:02:45.574
when they met up in New York.

00:02:45.574 --> 00:02:47.570
(Upbeat music)

00:02:47.570 --> 00:02:49.030
- Today is going to be a really big day

00:02:49.030 --> 00:02:50.890
because I'm taking my first step

00:02:50.890 --> 00:02:53.170
to being a real fashion designer.

00:02:53.170 --> 00:02:54.093
- Hi!
- Hi!

00:02:55.070 --> 00:02:56.780
- Welcome to Casa de Kimora,

00:02:56.780 --> 00:02:58.923
I'll show you around a little bit.

00:03:00.790 --> 00:03:03.460
Skylar has a lot of passion for design

00:03:03.460 --> 00:03:07.200
and as a business woman and
entrepreneur and a mother,

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:09.920
it's very important for
me to work and empower

00:03:09.920 --> 00:03:13.610
the dreams of young designers
and young women everywhere.

00:03:13.610 --> 00:03:15.890
So why don't you come into my office

00:03:15.890 --> 00:03:17.640
and we can chit-chat about some things

00:03:17.640 --> 00:03:19.320
and I can see what
you've brought me today.

00:03:19.320 --> 00:03:20.420
- I cannot wait to have a go

00:03:20.420 --> 00:03:21.890
at my fashion ideas with her.

00:03:21.890 --> 00:03:24.490
I'm really excited to show her my designs

00:03:24.490 --> 00:03:25.530
and I'm super excited to see

00:03:25.530 --> 00:03:26.370
what she says about it.

00:03:26.370 --> 00:03:28.150
Oh, here are some of my designs,

00:03:28.150 --> 00:03:29.960
this one is just like
a opposite of a dress

00:03:29.960 --> 00:03:32.240
with like a wrap-around type skirt.

00:03:32.240 --> 00:03:35.070
This one is like a balloon
sleeve with like a curve.

00:03:35.070 --> 00:03:35.903
- That's really cute.

00:03:35.903 --> 00:03:37.320
I'm gonna have to wear that.
(Skylar laughs)

00:03:37.320 --> 00:03:39.130
Her designs and her sketches

00:03:39.130 --> 00:03:42.620
are exciting and vibrant and fun

00:03:42.620 --> 00:03:45.200
and it shows a little
bit of her personality.

00:03:45.200 --> 00:03:46.379
- This one is,

00:03:46.379 --> 00:03:48.490
I actually sketched this one last night.

00:03:48.490 --> 00:03:49.660
I was little bit nervous

00:03:49.660 --> 00:03:50.610
to see what she had to say,

00:03:50.610 --> 00:03:51.810
but you have to have tough skin

00:03:51.810 --> 00:03:54.230
even when they say that

00:03:54.230 --> 00:03:56.147
they're not gonna use your designs.

00:03:56.147 --> 00:03:59.147
(Suspenseful Music)

00:04:01.970 --> 00:04:03.360
- Okay I see a lot of things here

00:04:03.360 --> 00:04:04.930
I feel like we should work with.

00:04:04.930 --> 00:04:06.470
I definitely think we should take these

00:04:06.470 --> 00:04:08.320
back to the design team,

00:04:08.320 --> 00:04:10.490
and then we could crank
some of these thing out.

00:04:10.490 --> 00:04:12.010
All the sketches are really great,

00:04:12.010 --> 00:04:13.630
but the red stands out to me a lot

00:04:13.630 --> 00:04:15.670
because you can dress
it up or dress it down,

00:04:15.670 --> 00:04:16.900
you can put it with a blazer.

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:18.730
So we can absolutely help her

00:04:18.730 --> 00:04:20.240
create that top and that pants.

00:04:20.240 --> 00:04:21.073
This is the team

00:04:21.073 --> 00:04:23.510
this is Caesar, Megan and Karen.

00:04:23.510 --> 00:04:24.834
This is my little Skylar.

00:04:24.834 --> 00:04:26.940
- When I walked in today I did not think

00:04:26.940 --> 00:04:29.580
that we would actually be
able to make an outfit,

00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:31.701
and I think this is just gonna be amazing.

00:04:31.701 --> 00:04:33.554
- So you matching this over that,

00:04:33.554 --> 00:04:34.886
and your belting.

00:04:34.886 --> 00:04:36.000
- Yeah like that.

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:37.850
- Boom! We're going, we're going.

00:04:37.850 --> 00:04:39.340
So this is where it's all starts.

00:04:39.340 --> 00:04:40.950
- Before this I really only

00:04:40.950 --> 00:04:43.450
just had me working on all of my outfits.

00:04:43.450 --> 00:04:45.340
- So it starts with your sketch,

00:04:45.340 --> 00:04:47.420
and now that you've chosen a fabric,

00:04:47.420 --> 00:04:49.000
we'll create a pattern then we'll work it

00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:50.370
and check in with the measurements,

00:04:50.370 --> 00:04:51.490
and things along the way.

00:04:51.490 --> 00:04:52.520
- Yes, and then start assembling them.

00:04:52.520 --> 00:04:54.260
It's like building a house.

00:04:54.260 --> 00:04:56.450
- When you've been in the
business as long as I have,

00:04:56.450 --> 00:04:58.430
you look more towards creating a legacy.

00:04:58.430 --> 00:05:00.420
So I think it when you can look back

00:05:00.420 --> 00:05:02.220
and someone says

00:05:02.220 --> 00:05:03.355
you know you helped me

00:05:03.355 --> 00:05:04.570
you helped me create,

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:05.460
you helped me design,

00:05:05.460 --> 00:05:06.920
you helped me realize my vision.

00:05:06.920 --> 00:05:09.030
That is how I measure success.

00:05:09.030 --> 00:05:11.170
And next time we see
you this will be done.

00:05:11.170 --> 00:05:12.003
- Cool!

00:05:13.020 --> 00:05:15.040
I definitely won't forget this day,

00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:17.079
because I think that one day

00:05:17.079 --> 00:05:19.150
I'll be a big designer

00:05:19.150 --> 00:05:22.216
and see that this is
where it all like began.

00:05:22.216 --> 00:05:25.216
(audience applauds)

00:05:26.202 --> 00:05:27.107
- All right so that is,

00:05:27.107 --> 00:05:32.107
I just love seeing a
young woman like that bold

00:05:32.130 --> 00:05:33.250
and that like just projected,

00:05:33.250 --> 00:05:34.460
she said, "I will be."

00:05:34.460 --> 00:05:35.620
Like she didn't say, "I want to be",

00:05:35.620 --> 00:05:37.020
she said, "I will be a big designer."

00:05:37.020 --> 00:05:38.950
And I'm like projecting
that is everything.

00:05:38.950 --> 00:05:40.300
- Absolutely.
- Wow!

00:05:40.300 --> 00:05:41.133
- Speak it!

00:05:41.133 --> 00:05:42.150
- Yeah, you have to.

00:05:42.150 --> 00:05:43.950
So what's the most important thing

00:05:43.950 --> 00:05:46.775
that you felt like you
wanted to teach Skylar?

00:05:46.775 --> 00:05:48.564
- I wanted her to know,

00:05:48.564 --> 00:05:51.890
first of all I wanted her to understand

00:05:51.890 --> 00:05:54.180
which she did touch on rejection.

00:05:54.180 --> 00:05:55.230
You may go places,

00:05:55.230 --> 00:05:56.810
I make it all the time,
I make stuff all the time

00:05:56.810 --> 00:05:59.020
and all the magazines
that everybody write it,

00:05:59.020 --> 00:06:00.170
they say I hate it.
- Mm hmm.

00:06:00.170 --> 00:06:01.180
- Or they say I love it.

00:06:01.180 --> 00:06:02.960
You have to be able to
like roll with the punches.

00:06:02.960 --> 00:06:04.350
Like she said it, have a thick skin

00:06:04.350 --> 00:06:06.150
so I wanted her to understand that.

00:06:06.150 --> 00:06:08.030
But beyond that, I wanted
her to understand that

00:06:08.030 --> 00:06:09.070
the sky is the limit.

00:06:09.070 --> 00:06:10.930
That you can be a girl boss,

00:06:10.930 --> 00:06:13.241
you can be a woman designer.

00:06:13.241 --> 00:06:14.422
(Crowd applause.)

00:06:14.422 --> 00:06:16.124
You can be a mom and a businesswoman.

00:06:16.124 --> 00:06:18.450
You can be you know who you are,

00:06:18.450 --> 00:06:20.710
we are who we are, and we can get it done.

00:06:20.710 --> 00:06:24.010
So there's no labels
or titles or boundaries

00:06:24.010 --> 00:06:25.470
that should hold us back
- [Kelly] Yeah no limits

00:06:25.470 --> 00:06:26.830
- No limits
- Yeah.

00:06:26.830 --> 00:06:30.210
So Kimora's team was able to
put together Skylar's design

00:06:30.210 --> 00:06:32.130
and she's here to show it off.

00:06:32.130 --> 00:06:33.209
Come on out!

00:06:33.209 --> 00:06:35.792
(Upbeat music)

00:06:38.242 --> 00:06:39.075
- So cute

00:06:40.032 --> 00:06:42.282
(Cheering)

00:06:47.497 --> 00:06:49.177
- Come on over!

00:06:49.177 --> 00:06:51.700
You look so good!
- Thank you.

00:06:51.700 --> 00:06:53.214
- Oh my gosh!

00:06:53.214 --> 00:06:54.297
You did this!

00:06:55.268 --> 00:06:56.101
Look at that team work!

00:06:56.101 --> 00:06:56.940
Come on over!

00:06:56.940 --> 00:06:59.561
- Wow, hi!
- Sit down with us.

00:06:59.561 --> 00:07:00.508
- How are you?

00:07:00.508 --> 00:07:01.979
That's Liv.
- Hey nice to meet you.

00:07:01.979 --> 00:07:03.768
Hello how are you?

00:07:03.768 --> 00:07:05.623
You look beautiful.
- Thank you

00:07:05.623 --> 00:07:06.920
- And I'm just saying

00:07:06.920 --> 00:07:08.050
you had your arms behind your back,

00:07:08.050 --> 00:07:09.340
I'll be like girl when you look that good.

00:07:09.340 --> 00:07:10.800
Just walk with those arms proud.

00:07:10.800 --> 00:07:11.633
(All laughing)

00:07:11.633 --> 00:07:13.130
I'm like so sway sway.

00:07:13.130 --> 00:07:14.906
you look so cute, the hair everything,

00:07:14.906 --> 00:07:16.870
the whole look is nice.

00:07:16.870 --> 00:07:17.860
Was this exciting?

00:07:17.860 --> 00:07:19.160
What was your favorite part?

00:07:19.160 --> 00:07:21.800
- So I mean I love New
York but my favorite part

00:07:21.800 --> 00:07:25.590
was definitely getting to
see like how the team works.

00:07:25.590 --> 00:07:28.650
And like when she comes
in, like her presence

00:07:28.650 --> 00:07:30.480
everybody is just like oh let me,

00:07:30.480 --> 00:07:32.934
like they're ready to help her.

00:07:32.934 --> 00:07:34.150
(Audience laughs)

00:07:34.150 --> 00:07:36.063
- That's a girl boss! Hey!

00:07:37.210 --> 00:07:38.430
- And you can just tell
that everybody like

00:07:38.430 --> 00:07:39.650
loves working with her.

00:07:39.650 --> 00:07:40.483
- That's amazing,

00:07:40.483 --> 00:07:42.180
hey that does say a lot about people, yes.

00:07:42.180 --> 00:07:44.580
- I really just wanted to thank you

00:07:44.580 --> 00:07:45.602
for having like,

00:07:45.602 --> 00:07:48.220
you have like a whole bunch of jobs,

00:07:48.220 --> 00:07:49.581
you have kids,

00:07:49.581 --> 00:07:51.050
I just want to thank you for like,

00:07:51.050 --> 00:07:52.050
you know, having me.

00:07:54.251 --> 00:07:55.802
You're hugging me.
- You're welcome.

00:07:55.802 --> 00:07:58.554
You look amazing.
- Thank you.

00:07:58.554 --> 00:07:59.413
- This came out good.

00:07:59.413 --> 00:08:00.850
You did this under the gun.

00:08:00.850 --> 00:08:02.354
- That's amazing like would you...

00:08:02.354 --> 00:08:03.187
this is adorable!

00:08:03.187 --> 00:08:04.687
- The back details are amaze--

00:08:04.687 --> 00:08:05.647
- I know the back did y'all see it?

00:08:05.647 --> 00:08:07.850
Stand up, let's show them that back again.

00:08:07.850 --> 00:08:08.888
Look how cute that is.

00:08:08.888 --> 00:08:11.123
(Applause)

00:08:11.123 --> 00:08:13.045
- [Kelly] So cute.
- Amazing.

00:08:13.045 --> 00:08:13.878
- It's cute.

00:08:13.878 --> 00:08:14.790
- I can see you in that,

00:08:14.790 --> 00:08:15.623
you're already wearing

00:08:15.623 --> 00:08:17.520
like a red kinda orange.
- [Liv] Yes.

00:08:17.520 --> 00:08:19.037
- So Kimora you have one more surprise

00:08:19.037 --> 00:08:20.210
for everyone though right?

00:08:20.210 --> 00:08:23.160
- Yes so when Skylar brought in her design

00:08:23.160 --> 00:08:26.850
she has like every good
designer has a sketch book

00:08:26.850 --> 00:08:28.737
and I being me I'm like, "I want that

00:08:28.737 --> 00:08:30.790
and we have to make that
and we have to do that."

00:08:30.790 --> 00:08:33.150
So we did this outfit for her.
- Yeah.

00:08:33.150 --> 00:08:36.820
- She created it, sketched
it, we assembled it,

00:08:36.820 --> 00:08:38.970
manufactured it if you would,
and made it come to life.

00:08:38.970 --> 00:08:41.630
And then I have on
another one of her designs

00:08:41.630 --> 00:08:43.170
from her sketch book.
- This is you?

00:08:43.170 --> 00:08:44.642
Wait stand up for us!

00:08:44.642 --> 00:08:46.892
(Applause)

00:08:49.893 --> 00:08:51.650
- [Kelly] Look it's amazing

00:08:51.650 --> 00:08:52.822
- [Skylar] Thank you

00:08:52.822 --> 00:08:54.057
- [Kelly] Look at that!

00:08:54.057 --> 00:08:57.800
- Now I didn't make the
sleeve as voluminous

00:08:57.800 --> 00:08:59.470
cause mama is already a little voluminous.

00:08:59.470 --> 00:09:01.355
I took it down--
(Laughter)

00:09:01.355 --> 00:09:03.200
A little point tuck at the top.

00:09:03.200 --> 00:09:04.270
But yeah this is hers.

00:09:04.270 --> 00:09:06.730
- That's almost like a cool
red carpet version too.

00:09:06.730 --> 00:09:07.563
The voluminous?

00:09:09.440 --> 00:09:12.173
- These are our Skylar
Baby Phat colabarations.

00:09:12.173 --> 00:09:13.870
- [Kelly] That is amazing!
- We're on our way,

00:09:13.870 --> 00:09:15.268
we're working for you.

00:09:15.268 --> 00:09:16.845
(Laughter)

00:09:16.845 --> 00:09:18.220
- Are you loving it?

00:09:18.220 --> 00:09:19.510
Did you just love being in the building?

00:09:19.510 --> 00:09:20.860
Everything just soaking it all in?

00:09:20.860 --> 00:09:22.776
- Yeah it was... I learned a lot.

00:09:22.776 --> 00:09:24.060
- That's so cool!

00:09:24.060 --> 00:09:26.433
That is so cool, what a blessing?

